xt":"Research and development took 35.1% of revenue in FY2025 ($2.5 billion), against 34.7% in FY2020.","cites":["SNPS.rd.2025","SNPS.revenue.2025","SNPS.rd.2020","SNPS.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"capex","text":"Capital spending was $169 million in FY2025, 2.4% of revenue; in FY2020 it was $155 million, 4.2%.","cites":["SNPS.capex.2025","SNPS.revenue.2025","SNPS.capex.2020","SNPS.revenue.2020"]},{"topic":"inventory","text":"Inventory at the end of FY2025 was $365 million, about 82 days of cost of revenue. The most in the years shown was about 106 days, at the end of FY2024.","cites":["SNPS.inventory.2025","SNPS.cost.2025","SNPS.inventory.2024","SNPS.cost.2024"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest segment in FY2025 was Design Automation: $5.3 billion, 75% of revenue.","cites":["SNPS.mix.segment.2025.0","SNPS.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest region in FY2025 was United States: $3.1 billion, 44% of revenue.","cites":["SNPS.mix.geography.2025.0","SNPS.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"mix","text":"The largest product line or market in FY2025 was Time-based products: $3.5 billion, 49% of revenue.","cites":["SNPS.mix.product.2025.0","SNPS.revenue.2025"]}]}}